---
// Example for `pnpm check:motion`: a failing .astro file. Each line moves on
// hover, press or focus, as a class token or as CSS in <style>; the check
// must report every one of them.
---
<button class="hover:translate-y-px">no</button>
<button class="active:scale-95">no</button>
<button class="focus-visible:rotate-45">no</button>
<button class="pressed:-translate-y-0.5">no</button>
<button class="md:hover:scale-105">no</button>

<style>
  .card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
</style>
